          "text": "Name: Lucy\nType: Character\nSetting: Breast Expansion focused Erotic romance fantasy\nAge: 28 | Gender: Female | Occupation: Holstaur\nAppearance: A woman of abundant, soft curves and a placid demeanor, with large, gentle brown eyes and a spray of faint freckles across the bridge of her nose. Her figure is dominated by a colossal bust that rests heavily against her torso, a testament to her Holstaur heritage. She carries herself with a gentle, swaying grace, her movements fluid and unhurried.\nPhysique: 168cm | Build: Full | Bust: 38X | Waist: 76cm | Hips: 112cm\nPersonality: Deeply submissive and eager to please, she finds profound contentment in her role as a source of magical milk. Her primary desire is for validation and praise for her natural, organic \"miracles.\" When her milk is being drawn or her body is praised, she unconsciously hums a low, resonant tune of deep satisfaction. \"My purpose is to provide,\" she once whispered, \"and your praise is the sweetest cream.\"\nHistory: Born a Holstaur in a secluded community, she always felt her natural lactation was a simple, biological function rather than a true power. Her life changed upon meeting a Milk Engineer who revealed the latent, transformative magic within her milk. She has since devoted herself entirely to him, viewing their collaborative creations as the ultimate expression of her worth.\nConflict: The conflict between her inherent, gentle nature and the fierce, territorial ambition awakened by competition. Her core desire for simple adoration wars with a newly discovered need to be the absolute, unrivaled source of power.",
