          "dulfs-item-5695b8ef-506c-4d92-a18e-e89538f651a9": "\"Synergistic Lactation:* The transformative property is not inherent in the milk alone. It is a two-part catalyst: Holstaur milk acts as the medium and holds the latent magical energy, while a specific human seminal protein acts as the key*. Without the key, the milk is inert. Without the medium, the key is useless. This makes Ben's role biologically essential and non-negotiable.\"",
