          "dulfs-item-b6232940-e65a-4411-8973-5774fb83eb1c": "\"Essential Draining:** Each transformation draws a significant amount of physical and magical energy from the Holstaur (Lucy). Rapid or excessive expansion leaves her physically weakened, dazed, and her milk temporarily loses its potency. Lyra's engineered biology mitigates this, draining her less efficiently but making her more reliant on Ben's semen to sustain her unnatural state.\"",
          "dulfs-item-8c2d1646-126b-49a3-a8ac-826466cfff19": "\"Metabolic Anchoring:** The transformative effects are not purely cosmetic. The altered mass is metabolically anchored, requiring a proportional increase in caloric and magical intake to sustain. If a subject is undernourished, the magic becomes unstable, leading to painful retraction, \\\"softening,\\\" or even a catastrophic, uncontrolled release of stored energy.\"",
