          "dulfs-item-c05b991d-aca5-42d6-bd09-f18890f7636a": "\"Ecstatic Contagion:** The emotional high from a successful transformation releases a potent magical pheromone. This pheromone can induce feelings of intense jealousy, possessiveness, or a desperate craving for the next \\\"treatment\\\" in other subjects within the enclosed space. The cottage's poor ventilation makes this a constant, escalating influence.\"",
