          "dulfs-item-d4ed9403-c022-4e9b-82d6-5d795b7d2b87": "\"Alchemical Imprinting:** Lyra's radical self-rewrite was not a clean process. She used her artisanal alchemical knowledge to guide the transformation, inadvertently imprinting a fragment of her own consciousness and ambition into the magical matrix of her new body. Her breasts now act as a secondary, instinct-driven mind, capable of subtly influencing her emotions and actions towards greater growth and competition.\"",
